{"dur": 25.15, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Pendant des années, j'ai cru que j'étais lent.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 3.41, "words": [{"w": "Pendant", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "des", "t": 1.593}, {"w": "années,", "t": 1.789}, {"w": "j'ai", "t": 2.133}, {"w": "cru", "t": 2.379}, {"w": "que", "t": 2.575}, {"w": "j'étais", "t": 2.772}, {"w": "lent.", "t": 3.165}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Jusqu'au jour où j'ai compté.", "t0": 4.21, "t1": 5.813, "words": [{"w": "Jusqu'au", "t": 4.21}, {"w": "jour", "t": 4.708}, {"w": "où", "t": 4.984}, {"w": "j'ai", "t": 5.15}, {"w": "compté.", "t": 5.426}]}, {"id": "compte", "text": "Sur un plan de ferraillage, quatre-vingts pour cent du temps, c'est du dessin. Pas du calcul.", "t0": 6.193, "t1": 11.422, "words": [{"w": "Sur", "t": 6.193}, {"w": "un", "t": 6.428}, {"w": "plan", "t": 6.605}, {"w": "de", "t": 6.898}, {"w": "ferraillage,", "t": 7.075}, {"w": "quatre-vingts", "t": 7.78}, {"w": "pour", "t": 8.543}, {"w": "cent", "t": 8.837}, {"w": "du", "t": 9.131}, {"w": "temps,", "t": 9.307}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 9.659}, {"w": "du", "t": 10.012}, {"w": "dessin.", "t": 10.188}, {"w": "Pas", "t": 10.599}, {"w": "du", "t": 10.834}, {"w": "calcul.", "t": 11.011}]}, {"id": "declic", "text": "Le problème, ce n'était pas moi. C'était l'outil.", "t0": 11.802, "t1": 14.375, "words": [{"w": "Le", "t": 11.802}, {"w": "problème,", "t": 11.966}, {"w": "ce", "t": 12.459}, {"w": "n'était", "t": 12.623}, {"w": "pas", "t": 13.061}, {"w": "moi.", "t": 13.28}, {"w": "C'était", "t": 13.499}, {"w": "l'outil.", "t": 13.937}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "Alors on en a fabriqué un autre : CivRebar AI, dans AutoCAD.", "t0": 14.755, "t1": 19.089, "words": [{"w": "Alors", "t": 14.755}, {"w": "on", "t": 15.204}, {"w": "en", "t": 15.428}, {"w": "a", "t": 15.652}, {"w": "fabriqué", "t": 15.801}, {"w": "un", "t": 16.474}, {"w": "autre", "t": 16.698}, {"w": ":", "t": 17.146}, {"w": "CivRebar", "t": 17.221}, {"w": "AI,", "t": 17.894}, {"w": "dans", "t": 18.118}, {